  <description>
    x500 quadrotor with stereo camera for VINS-Fusion VIO.
    Features:
    - Stereo camera pair (752x480 @ 20Hz, 120mm baseline)
    - IMU sensor (200Hz)
    - Camera intrinsics configured for direct VINS integration
  </description>
</model>
